    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d373">

                <pb facs="0483" n="1237" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp02v02/pg1237"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 841.731/1823</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Great Britain</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Page</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-07-13T23:00:00+01:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 13, 1917, 11 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received July 13, 6.18 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>6732. Foreign Office deferring departure two British cable censorship officials
                    pending your approval plan set forth in my 6663, July 6, 5 p.m. Naval attaché
                    states that Navy Department telegraphed him July 3, designating No. 15003, to
                    get both officials.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Page</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
